description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests recapping the current analyst-agent
  conversation into concise, chronological case notes for a ticket or record - reading
  the chat transcript and writing a single-block narrative of the goal, the queries
  and actions the agent ran, what was produced or found, and the current outcome (across
  any SOC-facing agent such as investigation, threat hunting, detection engineering,
  data onboarding, or automation). Examples: "recap this investigation", "write case
  notes from this chat", "summarize what we did here for the ticket". Do not activate
  for summarizing raw XQL result tables, writing a formal incident report, or extracting
  indicators and performing new agent actions.'
